---
// Section 11, Three ways in (locked): compact dark band, three clickable rows,
// and a Trust Center line underneath.
---
<section class="r-ways" aria-labelledby="ways-title">
  <div class="glow g1" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="glow g2" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="wrap in">
    <div class="grid">
      <div><h2 id="ways-title">Start with the outage you already had.</h2><p class="sub">Every way in is free to start. Nothing is installed until you say so.</p></div>
      <div class="rows">
        <a class="r" href="/replay" style="--c:#FF6B4A"><span class="ic"><i class="ti ti-rewind-backward-10" aria-hidden="true"></i></span><span><b>Replay my outage</b><span>Send one past incident. Get a report for your board.</span></span><i class="ti ti-arrow-right ar" aria-hidden="true"></i></a>
        <a class="r" href="/demo" style="--c:#9FB4D6"><span class="ic"><i class="ti ti-player-play" aria-hidden="true"></i></span><span><b>Open the live demo</b><span>Harbour Bank, mid incident. No sign up.</span></span><i class="ti ti-arrow-right ar" aria-hidden="true"></i></a>
        <a class="r" href="/pricing#founding-partners" style="--c:#3DAE80"><span class="ic"><i class="ti ti-users" aria-hidden="true"></i></span><span><b>Become a founding partner</b><span>Five places at founder pricing.</span></span><i class="ti ti-arrow-right ar" aria-hidden="true"></i></a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="tl"><i class="k"></i><b>Check us before you trust us.</b><span>Test results, controls and documents, each with its date.</span><a href="/trust">Visit the Trust Center</a></div>
  </div>
</section>
<style is:global>
.r-ways{position:relative;overflow:hidden;background:#05070C;color:#fff;padding:88px 0 56px}
.r-ways .glow{position:absolute;pointer-events:none;border-radius:50%;filter:blur(60px)}
.r-ways .g1{width:520px;height:300px;left:-160px;top:-150px;background:rgba(255,107,74,.28)}.r-ways .g2{width:520px;height:300px;right:-160px;bottom:-190px;background:rgba(61,174,128,.24)}
.r-ways .in{position:relative}
.r-ways .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,1.1fr);gap:56px;align-items:center}
.r-ways h2{font-family:var(--display);font-variation-settings:'opsz' 96;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:-.035em;line-height:1.04;margin:0;font-size:clamp(34px,4vw,52px);color:#fff;text-wrap:balance}
.r-ways .sub{font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:#C9D1DC;margin:16px 0 0}
.r-ways .rows{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}
.r-ways .r{display:grid;grid-template-columns:44px minmax(0,1fr) 22px;gap:16px;align-items:center;padding:16px 18px;border:1px solid #232B3A;border-radius:14px;background:#0B0F18;transition:background .3s,border-color .3s}
.r-ways .r .ic{width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:11px;display:grid;place-items:center;background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--c) 18%,#0B0F18);color:var(--c);font-size:22px}
.r-ways .r b{display:block;font-size:17px;font-weight:600;color:#fff}.r-ways .r span span{display:block;font-size:14px;color:#C9D1DC;margin-top:3px}
.r-ways .r .ar{color:#C9D1DC;font-size:20px;transition:transform .3s,color .3s}
.r-ways .r:hover,.r-ways .r:focus-visible{border-color:var(--c);background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--c) 10%,#0B0F18)}
.r-ways .r:hover .ar,.r-ways .r:focus-visible .ar{transform:translateX(4px);color:var(--c)}
.r-ways .tl{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:40px;padding-top:20px;border-top:1px solid #1C2330;font-size:14.5px;color:#C9D1DC}
.r-ways .tl b{color:#fff;font-weight:600}.r-ways .tl a{color:#fff;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px}
.r-ways .tl .k{width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:#3DAE80;display:inline-block}
@media (max-width:900px){.r-ways .grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:28px}}
</style>
